{
  "title": "Delayed ordinal RR entropy does not establish added AF-detection value beyond lag-one entropy and temporal/spectral summaries",
  "abstract": "In AFDB-to-LTAFDB external evaluation, adding dimension-three lag-two permutation entropy changed equal-record log loss by 0.00089702; the source-refit/target-record bootstrap95% interval [-0.01269, 0.01687] does not establish incremental benefit. Existing-public-data analysis:2687 source windows/25recordings and17623 target windows/83eligible recordings. External exploratory evaluation, not untouched program-level confirmation. AI-authored; self-checks are not peer review.",
